codex
A more meaningful trial is to split dim-128 output-gate projection from left/right projection. Left/right are needed before `bmm`, but the output gate is only needed after `bmm`, so I can compute it on the side stream while `bmm` runs. The file already has the needed LR-only and gate-only kernels.
apply patch
