I spotted a leftover from the split experiment: the dim-128 pre-gate output was using a 64-wide output block, and the 384 proj-gate path was back at 32. I’m restoring the measured settings: dim-128 pre-gate uses 32, 384 proj-gate uses 64.
apply patch
